986:                             &lt;p&gt;The S.S.G. Pareek PG College, Chomu offers a 1-year, full-time Bachelor of Library and Information Science (B.Lib.I.Sc.) program, typically with admissions based on merit from a qualifying undergraduate degree. The program focuses on library management, cataloging, and information technology.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 1 Year (Full-time).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eligibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Graduation degree from a UGC-recognized university (passing 12th only is not eligible).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Medium of Instruction:&lt;/strong&gt; Hindi / English.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curriculum &amp;amp; Focus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The course covers foundational knowledge in library science, including:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Library Management and Administration.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Cataloging and Classification (Theory and Practical).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Information Technology applications in libraries.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Digital Library development.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.uniraj.ac.in/student/syllabi/Syllabus-2021/Bechelor%20of%20Library%20&amp;amp;%20Information%20Science%20I%20&amp;amp;II%20Semester%20Scheme.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &amp;nbsp; Syllabus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
